<p>An SCP about a simple air cooling fan that turns oxygen into other elements or stuff like helium or carbon dixoide but the change is permanent. Been trying to rewrite it following critique from here and in the IRC chatroom but none of them have been as well received as the original draft. The current version of the draft is available under the ORIGINAL tab.</p>
<p>Critique of any part of the draft is very much welcome! I am concerned about the draft's length, structure and presentation of narrative/information, I feel these areas are where the draft and myself are weakest and detailed input here would be a great help. Thanks so much for taking the time to read through this.</p>
<p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/mightymightyena">http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/mightymightyena</a></p>
<p>Word count: 2,096 words (18/11/20)</p>
<p>I have received two greenlights from Ideas Critique. Here is <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13634701/first-scp-air-reconditioning-unit">greenlight #1</a> and here is <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13836146/air-reconditioning-unit">greenlight #2.</a></p>

