<p>Hello, gamer! Let's address a few of your points here.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[+]&nbsp;Reply&nbsp;time!</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
